# 2. THE HUMAN STORY

Dr. T is a real-life busy bee who wears many hats simultaneously.

She may be:

- A hospital professional.
- A clinic practitioner.
- A university dean.
- A mother.
- A daughter of a doctor.
- A wife.
- A representative at a medical congress.
- A researcher.
- A mentor.
- A lifelong learner.
- A person who also needs time for health, rest and personal interests.

Her challenge is not merely having too many tasks.

Her challenge is that every role has different responsibilities, people, decisions, deadlines and expectations.

When she moves from one role to another, she may lose the context of what she was doing, why a decision was made, what remains unfinished and what she must do next.

HatBridge addresses this problem.

## Product promise

**HatBridge helps people switch roles without losing continuity.**

It preserves the right context, at the right time, for the right role—while respecting privacy and protecting personal life.

